Source: pwmix
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Graham <graham@netlinux.co.uk>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkg-config,
 libpipewire-0.3-dev, libcairo2-dev, libpango1.0-dev, libx11-dev,
 libsystemd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/netlinux-ai/pwmix

Package: pwmix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pipewire
Description: mixer-style view for PipeWire
 Shows PipeWire applications, devices and the links between them as
 columns of mixer strips with volume and mute controls, and matches
 application streams to the desktop window that owns them.
